CALIBRATION ANALYSIS:
  Val loss and val accuracy moved together through epoch 30.
  After epoch 30, val loss continued to improve (1.1966 -> 1.1913) while accuracy
  dipped from 92.25% to 91.87-92.00%. This slight divergence indicates the model
  was becoming better calibrated (sharper probability distributions) rather than
  finding new correct predictions. Not a concern -- the model is well-calibrated.

