  - Warmup (ep20, LR=5e-08): No learning, baseline held. Correct behavior.
  - Peak LR (ep21-22, LR=5e-06): Immediate improvement to 91.63%. Fast response.
  - Early decay (ep23-24, LR~4.7e-06): Consolidation, slight dip at ep24.
  - Mid decay (ep25-28, LR~3.5e-06): Strong gains to 92.00%.
  - Late decay (ep29-31, LR~2.4e-06): Peak performance window. Best accuracy here.
  - Fine tune (ep32-35, LR~1.4e-06): Val loss still improving, accuracy plateau.
  The LR schedule was effective. The sweet spot was 2-3e-06 (late decay phase).

